        "content": {
          "heading": "TEZHHOMAYAA VALUES",
          "subheading": "",
          "description": "BE JOYFUL\nWe believe our energies are felt in every product we create. Our creative process starts with keeping ourselves in a pleasant and joyful state.\n\nKEEP EVOLVING\nWe put tremendous emphasis on unleashing more and more of our hidden potential.\n\nREMOVE UNNECESSARY\nSimplicity. Starting with something as basic as the side seams, we make sure every unnecessary thing is removed from our product.\n\nREJECT UNSPECTACULAR\nReject everything that is not absolutely spectacular : we do not go ahead at 99%.",
